# Example environment file. Copy to `.Renviron` (which is git-ignored) and fill
# in real values. R reads `.Renviron` automatically on startup.
#
# --- Gene List Builder ---
#
# Google Gemini API key for the AI curation step. Without it the app still
# works: curation falls back to a top-N-by-rank selection.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=replace-me
#
# Optional: override the Gemini model used for curation.
# GLB_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
#
# Optional: NCBI E-utilities credentials (only needed once a ClinVar/NCBI Gene
# source is added; raises the request rate limit). Not used by the v1 sources.
# ENTREZ_KEY=replace-me
# ENTREZ_EMAIL=you@example.org
